  <para style="h">Tesalonika 2</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tesalonika bi 2</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tesalonika 2</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tes2</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonika bi 2</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Paulo kɛ Sila kɛ Timoteo nɛ ngma womi nɛ ɔ kɛ ya ha Tesalonika asafo ɔ nɛ wa Tsɛ Mawu kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo ngɛ e yi baae ɔ.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je Tsɛ Mawu kɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, e sa kaa waa na Mawu si daa kɛ ha nyɛ, nɛ e ji wa blɔ nya ni tsumi kɛ ha Mawu, ngɛ nyakpɛ blɔ nɔ nɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi gu kɛ wa a, kɛ suɔmi nɛ nyɛ na kɛ ha nyɛ si bi ɔ. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Wa na bua jɔmi nɛ wa deɔ asafo kpa amɛ tsui si tomi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ, kɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ nyɛ na ngɛ Mawu mi ɔ, tse be ɔ, nyɛ ngɛ haomi kɛ he hiami mi. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Blɔhi a nɔ nɛ Mawu guu kɛ tsuɔ e ni ɔmɛ a ti kake ji enɛ ɔ nɛ, ejakaa e ngɛ nyɛ haomi ɔmɛ a nɔ gue kɛ dla nyɛ kɛ ha e hiɔwe matsɛ yemi ɔ, <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />nɛ ja a nɔuu kɛ̃ e ngɛ kojomi kɛ tue gblami dlae kɛ to nihi nɛ ngɛ nyɛ yi mi wae ɔ.<verse eid="2TH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ nɔ nae ɔ dee ke, Mawu ma ha waa kɛ nyɛ tsuo he jɔɔmi, benɛ Nutsɔ Yesu ma pue tlukaa kɛ je hiɔwe ngɛ la nɛ ngɛ tsoe ɔ mi kɛ e bɔfo ngua amɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Nɛ e ma ba kojo nihi nɛ hla we kaa a maa le Mawu, kɛ nihi nɛ kua e blɔ nya tomi nɛ e ma kɛ he a yi wami kɛ gu wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />A ma kpata a hɛ mi nɛ a kɛ Nutsɔ ɔ kpɛti ma gba kɛ ya neneene, nɛ a be e anunyami he wami ɔ nae, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />be mi nɛ e maa ba nɛ a wo e hɛ mi nyami ngɛ níhi kulaa nɛ e pee kɛ ha e ni klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ ɔ. Nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ maa piɛ nihi nɛ ma je e yi ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa nyɛ he nɔ́ nɛ wa de nyɛ ngɛ e he ɔ ye.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa sɔleɔ daa kɛ haa nyɛ konɛ wa Mawu ɔ nɛ pee nyɛ bimɛ nɛ e suɔ, nɛ e ha nyɛɛ hi kɛ pi si kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae ɔ, nɛ e ha nyɛ e he wami ɔ ngɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ nya. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, nɔ tsuaa nɔ ma bɔni Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo biɛ ɔ yi jemi ngɛ yiblii nɛ nyɛ wo ɔ he je, nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ hɛ mi nɛ maa ba nyami pe kulaa ji kaa e nihi ji nyɛ. Enɛ ɔ tsuo maa ba mi ngɛ wa Mawu ɔ kɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo mɔbɔ nami ɔ nya.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo bami ekohu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ngɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo bami ɔ kɛ wa he nya buami nɛ wa ma kɛ ya kpee lɛ ɔ he ɔ, wa kpa nyɛ pɛɛ, mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />nyɛ juɛmi nɛ ko futu nɛ nyɛ jijaa, kaa be ɔ ba momo. Ke a de nyɛ ke a na ni nami ko loo sɛ titli ko kɛ je Mawu ngɔ, loo womihi kɛ je ye ngɔ ngɛ be nɛ ɔ he ɔ, nyɛ ko he nɛ nyɛɛ ye. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ a sisi nyɛ ngɛ enɛ ɔ he. Ejakaa ja níhi enyɔ ba mi lolo loko ji jamɛ a be ɔ maa su. Kekle nɔ́ ji, be maa ba nɛ a maa te si wawɛɛ kɛ si Mawu, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, atuã tsɔlɔ nɛ ji hɛ mi kpatami bi ɔ maa ba. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />E maa te si kɛ wo mawu fɛɛ mawu, nɛ e maa ku wɔ jami níhi. E ma ya hi Mawu we ɔ, nɛ e maa ngɔ e he kaa lɛ ji Mawu. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Anɛ nyɛ kai we kaa benɛ i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ, i de nyɛ enɛ ɔ lo? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Jehanɛ ɔ hu nyɛ le nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ e nya tsie nɛ e bɛ hiɛ ɔ lolo. Ejakaa ja e be ɔ su loko ji e maa ba.<verse eid="2TH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Se yi mi wami ni tsumi nɛ atuã tsɔlɔ nɛ ɔ ma ba tsu ɔ ngɛ nɔ yae momo ngɛ laami mi, nɛ lɛ nitsɛ lɛɛ e be bae, ja nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ lɛ blɔ tsie ɔ je e blɔ mi. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Lɔ ɔ loko ji yi kpɛti walɔ nɛ ɔ maa je kpo, nɛ mumi nɛ maa je Nutsɔ Yesu nya mi ɔ ma ngla lɛ, nɛ e hɛ mi kpɛmi ɔ ma kpata e hɛ mi. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Yayami bi nɛ ɔ maa ba kɛ Abosiami he wami nɛ e ba sisi nɔ tsuaa nɔ kɛ lakpa okadi kɛ nyakpɛ níhi. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Nɛ e maa sisi nihi nɛ a hɛ mi ma kpata amɛ wawɛɛ, ejakaa a he we anɔkuale munyu ɔ nɛ a ye konɛ a he a yi wami. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Mawu ma ha he blɔ nɛ a he lakpa munyu ɔ nɛ a ye kɛ a tsui kulaa; <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />nɛ a maa kojo mɛ kulaa ngɛ lakpa munyu ɔ nɛ a he ye nɛ a kua nɔ́ nɛ ji Anɔkuale ɔ, nɛ a naa yayami peemi he tsui ɔ.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Mamimɛ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ suɔ, wɔɔ lɛɛ e sa kaa waa na Mawu si daa kɛ ha nyɛ, ejakaa Mawu hla nyɛ kɛ je sisije ngɛ nyɛ yi wami hemi he, nɛ e tsukɔ nyɛ he kɛ gu Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ni tsumi kɛ Anɔkuale ɔ nɛ nyɛ he ye ɔ mi. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />E tsɔɔ nyɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ gu wa nɔ, nɛ e tsɛ nyɛ konɛ nyɛ na Nutsɔ Yesu anunyami ɔ eko.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, ngɛ enɛ ɔmɛ kulaa a he je ɔ, nyɛɛ da si kpɛii, nɛ nyɛɛ pɛtɛ Anɔkuale ɔ he, nɔ́ nɛ wa tsɔɔ nyɛ kɛ gu womihi nɛ wa ngma nyɛ benɛ waa kɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nitsɛ kɛ wa Tsɛ Mawu, nɔ nɛ suɔ wɔ nɛ e kɛ neneene bua jɔmi kɛ hɛ nɔ kami ha wɔ ngɛ e dloomi ɔ nya a, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />e wo nyɛ bua nɛ e ye kɛ bua nyɛ ngɛ munyu kpakpa tumi kɛ ni tsumi kpakpa tsumi kulaa mi.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ pɛtɛ anɔkuale ɔ he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Nyagbe mi ɔ, mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ bie nɛ nyɛɛ sɔle kɛ ha wɔ. Nyɛɛ sɔle nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ munyu ɔ nɛ gbɛ kɛ fia mlamlaamla nɛ e ye kunimi ngɛ he fɛɛ he, nɛ e tsake nihi kaa bɔ nɛ e tsake nyɛ hu ɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Nyɛɛ sɔle konɛ a je wɔ kɛ je nimli yayamihi a dɛ mi, ejakaa tsa pi nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ suɔ Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Se anɔkualetsɛ ji Nutsɔ ɔ, e maa wo nyɛ he wami, nɛ e maa bu nyɛ he kɛ je Abosiami dɛ mi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Wa ngɛ hɛ nɔ kami ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi kaa níhi nɛ wa tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ ngɛ a he ni tsue, nɛ nyɛ maa pee ja a daa. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ ha nyɛɛ nu Mawu suɔmi kɛ Kristo tsui si tomi ɔ sisi.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaimi titli ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Jehanɛ ɔ, mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, wa ngɛ nyɛ fae ngɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo biɛ mi, kaa nyɛɛ kɛ Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ hejɔtsɛ nɛ ko bɔ, nɔ nɛ tsu we ni tsumi nɛ wa to kɛ wo nyɛ dɛ ɔ he ni ɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Ejakaa nyɛ le klɛdɛɛ kaa e sa nɛ nyɛɛ kase wɔ. Nyɛ nɛ wɔ nɛ wa ngɛ hejɔ pee. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Wa yi nɔ ko ni yaka gu. Se mohu wa gboɔ dengme nɛ wa tsuɔ ni nyɔ kɛ pia bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa ko wo wa hɛ kɛ fɔ nyɛ ti nɔ ko nɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Tsa pi kaa wa be he blɔ nɛ waa kɛ wa hɛ fɔɔ nyɛ nɔ, se mohu, wa ngɛ hlae nɛ waa tsɔɔ nyɛ bɔ nɛ sa nɛ nyɛɛ bɔ nyɛ nya mi ngma he mɔde ha. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Nɛ benɛ waa kɛ nyɛ ngɛ po ɔ, wa wo nyɛ kita ke: “Nɔ nɛ sume kaa e tsuɔ ni ɔ, e ko ye ni hulɔ.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Se kɛ ɔ, wa nu he kaa nyɛ ti ni komɛ ngɛ hejɔ pee, a sume nɛ a tsu ni, nɛ a ngɔ a be kɛ ngɛ sieku yee. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Wa ngɛ kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ dee ngɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo biɛ mi kaa a kpa hejɔ peemi nɛ a tsu ni nɛ a na mɛ nitsɛmɛ a nya mi ngma. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Nɛ nyɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ piɛ ɔ hu ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke pɔ nɛ ko tɔ nyɛ he kɛ kpakpa peemi.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Ke nɔ ko yi munyuhi nɛ wa tu nyɛ ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ mi a nɔ ɔ, nyɛ kadi lɛ nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ nɛ ko bɔ, konɛ zo nɛ gbe lɛ nitsɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Nyɛ ko bu lɛ kaa he nyɛlɔ, se mohu nyɛɛ tu munyu kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ kaa nyɛmi nɛ sa slɔmi. <verse eid="2TH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />He jɔmi Mawu ɔ nitsɛ nɛ ha nyɛ he jɔmi ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi. Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ nyɛ kulaa nɛ hi si.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ami nitsɛ ye nine nya ningma ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, nɛ i kɛ ngɛ nyɛ biɔe kaa bɔ nɛ i pɔɔ peemi ngɛ ye sɛ womihi a nyagbe mi, kɛ tsɔɔ kaa ami nɛ i ngma niinɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dloomi ɔ kɛ nyɛ tsuo nɛ hi si.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>